# neofetch logo database.
#
# kind|ids|patterns|colors|file|sha256
#
# kind      distro: matched against the distro name (or --ascii_distro)
#           kernel: matched against the kernel name, when nothing else matched
# ids       os-release ID values ('ID:VARIANT_ID' for variants), space separated
# patterns  shell globs, comma separated, matched case-insensitively. First
#           matching row wins, so specific rows go above broader ones.
# colors    arguments for set_colors (c1 is also the title color)
# file      art file in this directory
# sha256    checksum of the art file (neofetch --rehash_ascii updates it)
#
# Lookup: ID:VARIANT_ID, then patterns, then ID, then each ID_LIKE, then kernel.
